<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thanks for your interest in Arizona State University’s Walter Cronkite School of Journalism and Mass Communication.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Our school is one of several at ASU with higher admission standards than the university admission requirement. Entering freshmen must have a minimum 3.00 ABOR high school GPA and no English deficiencies (four years of high school English).</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Freshmen must also meet one of the following minimum composite test scores:</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">1040 SAT or higher</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">22 ACT or higher</span></li></ul></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Please note that we do not consider the writing portion of either standardized test.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Incoming freshmen may qualify as a Dean’s Admit to the Cronkite School if their test scores or GPA fall slightly below our minimum requirements. These decisions are made once all documents have been received and processed by ASU.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">We have an additional pathway to Cronkite for students who are not directly admitted for their first semester, and we’d be happy to discuss that option with you.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">In the meantime, you may learn more about the Cronkite School’s <a href="https://cronkite.asu.edu/undergrad/admissions">undergraduate admission requirements</a> and explore our <a href="https://cronkite.asu.edu/professional-programs">11 professional programs</a>.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Cronkite students benefit from hands-on, immersive experiences and opportunities beginning in their first semester at ASU, with access to our state-of-the-art facilities and guidance from award-winning faculty.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">We also encourage you to <a href="https://vimeo.com/126430351">discover the Cronkite experience</a> through a program featurette produced by our students.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">For more information about the Cronkite School, please call me at&nbsp;</span>{!User.Phone}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Walter Cronkite School of Journalism and Mass Communication</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>